  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 603.01 Notification. An owner proposing to remove a dam impounding 10 acres or more shall comply with the requirements of RSA 211:11 and RSA 482:13.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
